[step] The 0.45 mm projecting hook cams the keeper beam inward during installation and provides the square withdrawal stop when released. Its full deflected envelope clears the receiver in checks.json; the physical coupon tests whether the printed hook survives and engages.
file: hardware/printed-parts/enclosure/tee-carrier/joint-coupon/coupon-only-keeper.stl
